00:23:05.410 --> 00:23:07.750
<b>Kaeru basho wa sono mune?
Where to return? To you?</b>

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:10.040
<b>Soretomo sora no hate ni?
Or to the end of the universe?</b>

00:23:10.040 --> 00:23:14.590
<b>Kono itami wa doko ni tadoritsukeru darou
